#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:5
#: 79932f7a2d204ce882cf53ce63823f1a
msgid "Advanced Failsafe Configuration"
msgstr "高级失控保护配置"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:7
#: 6973e855b90b4ccd81da9a2819bf2137
msgid ""
"The core failsafe functionality of Plane is based on RTL (Return to Launch)."
" It is able to initiate a RTL if the aircraft loses contact with the ground "
"station or loses RC control. That is fine for most users, but in some "
"situations more advanced failsafe capabilities are needed. That is what the "
"Advanced Failsafe options are for."
msgstr ""
"Plane 的核心失控保护功能基于 RTL（返航）。当飞机与地面站失去联系或失去 RC 控制时，它能够启动 "
"RTL。这对大多数用户来说已经足够，但某些情况下需要更高级的失控保护能力，高级失控保护选项正是为此而生。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:14
#: ca388a3c629f4d99923d82292e9ea3fb
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:16
#: 1dcd39050f4d40248a1765eaaac2cdba
msgid ""
"The advanced failsafe options for Plane were added for the `Outback "
"Challenge <http://www.uavoutbackchallenge.com.au/>`__ competition, and the "
"features are designed to fit the rules of that competition. Whereas normal "
"failsafe is oriented around saving the aircraft in case control is lost by "
"the pilot, the OBC rules are oriented around ensuring safe operation in a "
"defined region of airspace. This means that the advanced failsafe options "
"are designed to deliberately crash the aircraft if there is any risk that it"
" may fly outside of the region of airspace defined by a geographic boundary "
"and a maximum altitude."
msgstr ""
"Plane 的高级失控保护选项最初是为 `Outback Challenge "
"<http://www.uavoutbackchallenge.com.au/>`__ "
"比赛而添加的，其功能设计符合该比赛规则。普通失控保护的重心在于在飞手失去控制时保护飞机，而 OBC "
"规则则侧重于确保在划定空域内的安全运行。这意味着高级失控保护选项的设计是在飞机有超出地理围栏和最大高度限定区域风险时故意使其坠毁。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:25
#: ccb9bc3e6b484215ae7952db702edb8b
msgid ""
"While the advanced failsafe features of Plane were designed for the OBC "
"competition, they can be useful in other situations, and are very flexible. "
"They are also harder to configure, so please read this page carefully "
"several times before deciding whether to enable these features on your "
"aircraft."
msgstr ""
"尽管 Plane 的高级失控保护功能是为 OBC "
"比赛而设计的，但它也可用于其他场景，且非常灵活。不过其配置难度也较高，请在决定是否在您的飞机上启用这些功能之前，仔细阅读本页内容数遍。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:32
#: 38003c90dcb6400bb6bc211c0b48a31c
msgid "Mission based"
msgstr "基于任务"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:34
#: 41b5a6a0c1ef4107b6a42b3a5ef905c5
msgid ""
"The key difference between normal failsafe and the advanced failsafe (AFS) "
"options is that the AFS options are mission based. When a failsafe option "
"(such as loss of GPS lock or loss of ground station communications link) "
"happens, the AFS options specify a waypoint number in the mission that the "
"aircraft will switch to. This allows the pilot to configure a complex series"
" of actions to take when a failsafe event occurs - anything that can be "
"scripted as an Plane mission can be made to happen on failsafe events."
msgstr ""
"普通失控保护与高级失控保护（AFS）选项的关键区别在于：AFS 选项基于任务。当某个失控保护事件（例如 GPS 丢失或与地面站通信中断）发生时，AFS "
"选项会指定任务中的一个航点编号，飞机将切换至该航点。这允许飞手配置一系列复杂的失控保护动作——任何可在 Plane "
"任务中编程的行为都可以在失控保护事件时触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:43
#: aac5c35409d44e1784e97958399adc09
msgid ""
"Typically the pilot will setup the AFS options for failsafe conditions so "
"that the aircraft will loiter at its current location for some period of "
"time (say one minute) and then proceed back towards home via a pre-"
"determined flight path. It may also include changes in airspeed, changes in "
"altitude, automatic landing or anything else that can be programmed in a "
"mission. If the failsafe event stops (for example GPS lock is regained) then"
" the aircraft will switch back to the mission item it was previously flying "
"towards and continue the mission."
msgstr ""
"通常，飞手会将 AFS "
"失控保护条件设置为：飞机先在当前位置盘旋一段时间（比如一分钟），然后沿预定航线返回起飞点。这也可以包括改变空速、改变高度、自动降落或任何任务中可编程的其他行为。如果失控保护事件解除（例如"
" GPS 重新锁定），飞机将自动切回之前飞向的任务项并继续执行任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:52
#: c215dcbbadd64361aec5e058e01c1f7c
msgid ""
"This makes the AFS options only really appropriate for AUTO missions. If you"
" are primarily flying Plane in CRUISE mode or other modes then you should "
"use the standard failsafe options."
msgstr "这使得 AFS 选项仅真正适用于 AUTO 任务。如果您主要以 CRUISE 模式或其他模式飞行 Plane，应使用标准失控保护选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:57
#: d1bfba1c3ac441aba2345aef8f655fed
msgid "Enabling the AFS failsafe system"
msgstr "启用 AFS 失控保护系统"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:59
#: e96fa6ded77b402f8e9e2e17f9ff0bd8
msgid ""
"To enable the AFS failsafe system you need to set the "
":ref:`AFS_ENABLE<AFS_ENABLE>` parameter to 1. The default is zero, which "
"means all the other options are disabled."
msgstr ""
"要启用 AFS 失控保护系统，需将 :ref:`AFS_ENABLE<AFS_ENABLE>` 参数设置为 1。默认值为 0，即所有其他选项均被禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:61
#: 21348afd7d144b3baccaf62ca7932f0a
msgid ""
"Note that the AFS system is only built into Plane by default only on higher "
"memory autopilot boards like the CubeOrange and Pixhawk6X. Check the "
":ref:`Firmware Limitations page <binary-features>` for your autopilot."
msgstr ""
"请注意，AFS 系统默认仅内置于 Plane 中针对高内存飞控板（如 CubeOrange 和 Pixhawk6X）的版本。请查阅您飞控的 "
":ref:`固件限制页面 <binary-features>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:65
#: 7e322c3b219a431292d3f96476a48a58
msgid "AFS Termination"
msgstr "AFS 终止"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:67
#: 213226727f4c42d69434e26632daa0cb
msgid ""
"The concept of \"flight termination\" is key to understanding the AFS "
"failsafe system. Termination is where the aircraft deliberately dives into "
"the ground by setting all control surfaces to maximum and throttle is "
"disarmed so as to enter a spin, or in the case of QuadPlane, there is also "
"the option to immediately QLAND instead."
msgstr ""
"「飞行终止」的概念是理解 AFS 失控保护系统的关键。终止是指飞机通过将所有控制面偏转至最大并切断油门来故意俯冲入地以进入螺旋下坠状态；对于 "
"QuadPlane，还有立即执行 QLAND 的选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:72
#: c2f8b857e75d4b98b93090d3e6f77e79
msgid ""
"The AFS system will only start a termination if the "
":ref:`AFS_TERM_ACTION<AFS_TERM_ACTION>` is set to the magic value 42 or 43. "
"For any other value the AFS system will print a message on the GCS console "
"saying that it wants to terminate, but won't actually change the control "
"surfaces at all. Using a value other than 42 or 43 is useful for test "
"flights where you don't want the aircraft to terminate on a failsafe event. "
"A value of 42 immediately crashed the plane, while, if a QuadPlane, a value "
"of 43 will immediately execute a QLAND."
msgstr ""
"只有当 :ref:`AFS_TERM_ACTION<AFS_TERM_ACTION>` 设置为特殊值 42 或 43 时，AFS "
"系统才会开始执行终止。对于其他任何值，AFS "
"系统会在地面站控制台打印一条希望终止的消息，但实际上不会改变任何控制面。在不希望飞机因失控保护事件终止的测试飞行中，使用非 42 或 43 "
"的值非常有用。值为 42 时立即使飞机坠毁；若为 QuadPlane，值为 43 时将立即执行 QLAND。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:79
#: 326803eb256748569e8a7e4eed7c866c
msgid ""
"Note that if :ref:`AFS_TERM_ACTION<AFS_TERM_ACTION>` is not set to 42 then "
"other normal failsafe code is still active, for example if you have a "
"geofence enabled then the aircraft will fly back to the geofence return "
"point."
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果 :ref:`AFS_TERM_ACTION<AFS_TERM_ACTION>` 未设置为 "
"42，其他正常的失控保护代码仍然有效，例如，如果启用了电子围栏，飞机将飞回围栏返航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:83
#: 7ff5586fbb88479a9bff856956a866bd
msgid ""
"When enabled, the AFS termination system also sets up the secondary IO "
"micro-controller on the autopilot to terminate the aircraft if communication"
" is interrupted between the main FMU micro-controller and the IO micro-"
"controller, for example if the flight firmware crashes."
msgstr ""
"启用后，AFS 终止系统还会在飞控上设置辅助 IO 微控制器，当主 FMU 微控制器与 IO "
"微控制器之间的通信中断时（例如飞行固件崩溃），也会触发飞机终止。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:88
#: 1f620fe947434f969fdfeb9cb54f134e
msgid ""
"An AFS flight termination is not recoverable. Once your aircraft starts a "
"termination, there is no way to recover."
msgstr "AFS 飞行终止不可恢复。一旦飞机开始终止，将无法挽救。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:92
#: e5306e4c4c964d68a5b0d3ba7c24aeaa
msgid "Types of Failsafe Events"
msgstr "失控保护事件类型"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:94
#: 2b6e4e89643c4a89b51e7aab97f0ccfa
msgid "The AFS failsafe system supports five of types of failsafe events:"
msgstr "AFS 失控保护系统支持五种失控保护事件类型："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:96
#: 3bc1ab2bd720417e9cdc3cf7a278f73c
msgid "geofence breach"
msgstr "电子围栏突破"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:97
#: 1f4edfe4fe2f475e854ad21a97385483
msgid "maximum pressure altitude breach"
msgstr "超过最大气压高度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:98
#: f2e52ad2dd3c46a1b5e3cfaff41d2f89
msgid "GPS loss"
msgstr "GPS 丢失"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:99
#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:193
#: 32270d6423cf45648d1057f4f5a8ecc8 fd5d87a786f149e3a1571bb16d3b1d02
msgid "Ground station communications loss"
msgstr "地面站通信中断"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:100
#: 6f70193713c040b5926e6971c70e2c7e
msgid "barometer failure"
msgstr "气压计故障"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:102
#: 870d9f4c28bc4422ac99ad6fd2781314
msgid ""
"Each of these types of failures has its own specific handling, which is "
"described below."
msgstr "以下分别介绍每种故障类型的具体处理方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:106
#: 49bda52dafa0480491d6e7bdb5cfe483
msgid "Geofence Breach"
msgstr "电子围栏突破"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:108
#: 7bd6c30b640048ba8f3ad3d07bf0d59b
msgid ""
"If a :ref:`geofence <geofencing>` is enabled then the AFS failsafe module "
"will monitor the aircraft for a breach of the boundaries of the geofence "
"(and lower and upper geofence altitudes if set). If a breach happens then "
"the AFS system will immediately terminate the flight (see termination "
"above)."
msgstr ""
"如果启用了 :ref:`电子围栏 <geofencing>`，AFS "
"失控保护模块将监测飞机是否突破围栏边界（以及设置了上下限高度时的围栏高度限制）。一旦发生突破，AFS 系统将立即终止飞行（参见上方终止说明）。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:114
#: 6825bb5fcf9e4a0fa5ffde7a93134122
msgid ""
"In addition, if the total straight-line distance from arming point exceeds "
"the :ref:`AFS_MAX_RANGE<AFS_MAX_RANGE>` distance, then termination will "
"occur."
msgstr "此外，如果从解锁点起的直线距离超过 :ref:`AFS_MAX_RANGE<AFS_MAX_RANGE>` 设定的距离，也将触发终止。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:117
#: 58cedfbc1169414c86af39d9367e8f8a
msgid "Maximum pressure altitude breach"
msgstr "超过最大气压高度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:119
#: d193214e0bc0493793a4481c82b0f7e7
msgid ""
"When sharing airspace with other aircraft it is usual practice to define the"
" available flight altitudes in terms of a common reference pressure, "
"typically QNH (a reference to \"nautical height\"). The QNH reference "
"pressure, measured in millibar, is distributed to all aircraft either via a "
"radio message or through aviation internet and weather sites."
msgstr ""
"在与其他飞行器共享空域时，通常以公共参考气压来定义可用飞行高度，这个参考气压通常是 QNH（「海拔高度」的参考值）。QNH "
"参考气压以毫巴为单位，通过无线电消息或航空互联网及气象网站分发给所有飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:125
#: 29b1feef11464f898d429d1a7a6a8868
msgid ""
"Aircraft then use their barometer to measure the pressure relative to that "
"QNH pressure, which gives them an altitude reference which all aircraft in "
"the area should be using."
msgstr "飞行器随后使用气压计测量相对于 QNH 气压的气压值，从而获得该区域内所有飞行器应使用的统一高度基准。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:129
#: 3221bc0c4a284dc0bfed366d1600b943
msgid ""
"The AFS system is able to enforce a pressure altitude limit by setting the "
"QNH pressure in the :ref:`AFS_QNH_PRESSURE<AFS_QNH_PRESSURE>` parameter, as "
"a value in millibars. The pilot should then also set a pressure altitude "
"limit using the :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` parameter (in meters)."
" Note that this pressure altitude limit is relative to sea level (AMSL "
"stands for \"above mean sea level\")."
msgstr ""
"AFS 系统可通过在 :ref:`AFS_QNH_PRESSURE<AFS_QNH_PRESSURE>` 参数中设置 QNH "
"气压值（毫巴）来强制执行气压高度限制。飞手还需使用 :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` "
"参数（单位：米）设置气压高度限制。请注意，该气压高度限制以海平面（AMSL，即「平均海平面以上」）为基准。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:136
#: dfc3a1ca9ed04da4b684e1dbce8382f5
msgid ""
"If both of these parameters are set then the AFS system fill monitor "
"pressure altitude and will initiate a termination if the pressure altitude "
"rises above the :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>`."
msgstr ""
"如果两个参数均已设置，AFS 系统将监测气压高度，并在气压高度超过 :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` "
"时启动终止。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:140
#: ba2af0e319864976a6955fffa144bda1
msgid ""
"You need to be very careful to set the right "
":ref:`AFS_QNH_PRESSURE<AFS_QNH_PRESSURE>` for your local conditions on the "
"day of your flight, as the QNH pressure can be very different on different "
"days."
msgstr ""
"您需要非常谨慎地为您飞行当天的本地条件设置正确的 :ref:`AFS_QNH_PRESSURE<AFS_QNH_PRESSURE>`，因为 QNH "
"气压值每天差异可能很大。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:144
#: fbebbcc8560048dbb901464d96f3c596
msgid ""
"In addition to the QNH pressure limit, the AFS system also monitors the "
"health of your barometer. If the barometer is unhealthy for 5 seconds then "
"the AFS system will check the :ref:`AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS<AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS>` "
"parameter. If it is -1 (the default) then the aircraft will terminate "
"immediately. If it is not -1 then the AFS system will use the "
":ref:`AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS<AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS>` value as a margin to add to the "
"GPS height, and will allow the flight to continue if the GPS altitude plus "
"the :ref:`AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS<AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS>` value (in meters) is below the"
" :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` value. The purpose of this margin is "
"to account for the inaccuracy of GPS altitudes. A value of 200 is reasonable"
" for safety to ensure the :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` pressure "
"altitude is not breached."
msgstr ""
"除 QNH 气压限制外，AFS 系统还会监测气压计的健康状态。如果气压计异常超过 5 秒，AFS 系统将检查 "
":ref:`AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS<AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS>` 参数。如果该参数为 -1（默认值），飞机将立即终止。如果不为 "
"-1，AFS 系统将使用 :ref:`AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS<AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS>` 值作为加到 GPS "
"高度上的余量，并在「GPS 高度 + :ref:`AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS<AFS_AMSL_ERR_GPS>` 值（米）」低于 "
":ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` 值时允许飞行继续。该余量的目的是弥补 GPS 高度的不精确性。建议使用 "
"200 以确保不突破 :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` 气压高度限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:157
#: 2fe9a5d25a284aff92dab847dabe7896
msgid "GPS Loss"
msgstr "GPS 丢失"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:159
#: 93cb3487281d40f6b6db3b7ed7ab5ca9
msgid ""
"The AFS system monitors the health of your GPS receivers throughout the "
"flight. If all of your available GPS receivers lose position lock then this "
"initiates a GPS failure failsafe."
msgstr "AFS 系统在整个飞行过程中监测 GPS 接收机的健康状态。如果所有可用 GPS 接收机均丢失位置锁定，则触发 GPS 故障失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:163
#: 912dc27abf3d47f591fcf1dbaec27d42
msgid ""
"When a GPS failure occurs (which is defined as loss of GPS lock for 3 "
"seconds) the AFS system will look at the "
":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>` parameter. This parameter species a "
"waypoint number in your mission to use when a GPS failure occurs. If "
":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>` is non-zero the aircraft will change"
" current waypoint to the waypoint number specified in "
":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>`. You should setup your mission so "
"that the aircraft will perform whatever actions you want on GPS loss. For "
"example, you could have a set of waypoints starting at number 10 which first"
" loiter on the spot for 30 seconds, and then proceed back to the airfield. "
"You would then set :ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>` to 10 to enable "
"that part of the mission on loss of GPS lock."
msgstr ""
"当 GPS 故障发生时（定义为 GPS 丢锁超过 3 秒），AFS 系统将检查 "
":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>` 参数。该参数指定 GPS 故障发生时要跳转的任务航点编号。如果 "
":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>` 非零，飞机将把当前航点切换为 "
":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>` 中指定的航点编号。您应在任务中规划好 GPS "
"丢失时希望执行的操作。例如，可以从编号 10 起设置一组航点，先在原地盘旋 30 秒，然后返回机场。此时将 "
":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>` 设置为 10，即可在 GPS 丢锁时执行该任务段。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:174
#: fa3b38886cc94beea11d122f5f16bfa2
msgid ""
"When setting up mission items for GPS lock it is sometimes useful to include"
" \"loiter at the current location\" waypoints. That is achieved by setting "
"both the latitude and longitude of LOITER mission commands to zero."
msgstr "为 GPS 丢锁设置任务项时，有时使用「在当前位置盘旋」航点会很有用。通过将 LOITER 任务指令的经纬度均设为零即可实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:179
#: 454d6c3dd7e04d248880cd09568b1653
msgid ""
"If the GPS recovers after a GPS failsafe has started, then the aircraft will"
" automatically resume its mission where it left off."
msgstr "如果 GPS 失控保护启动后 GPS 重新锁定，飞机将自动从中断处继续执行任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:182
#: 40ed3d273cb04876b6ee01aedc06f9b0
msgid ""
"If :ref:`AFS_MAX_GPS_LOSS<AFS_MAX_GPS_LOSS>` is set to a non-zero number, "
"then it is used as a maximum count of the number of GPS failures that will "
"be allowed while returning to the mission after GPS lock is re-established. "
"This counter is only incremented if the 2nd GPS failure happens at least 30 "
"seconds after the previous one (to account for a short period of GPS "
"failure)."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`AFS_MAX_GPS_LOSS<AFS_MAX_GPS_LOSS>` 设置为非零数值，则该值用作在 GPS "
"重新锁定并返回任务后，允许再次 GPS 故障的最大次数。该计数器仅在第二次 GPS 故障发生在前一次故障至少 30 秒之后时才递增（以排除短暂的 GPS"
" 故障）。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:188
#: 75c527f6cb714a1c898518de45f823d8
msgid ""
"If during a period of GPS loss the aircraft also loses communications with "
"the ground station then this is termed a \"dual loss\", and the aircraft "
"will terminate if :ref:`AFS_DUAL_LOSS<AFS_DUAL_LOSS>` is 1."
msgstr ""
"如果在 GPS 丢失期间飞机同时也失去与地面站的通信，则称为「双重丢失」，若 :ref:`AFS_DUAL_LOSS<AFS_DUAL_LOSS>` 为"
" 1，飞机将终止。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:195
#: 84584eb59b7b431682b7fbb1297cfc4a
msgid ""
"The AFS system monitors the health of the link between your ground station "
"and your aircraft. It does this by looking for HEARTBEAT MAVLink messages "
"coming from the ground station."
msgstr "AFS 系统通过监听来自地面站的 HEARTBEAT MAVLink 消息来监测地面站与飞机之间的链路健康状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:199
#: 457d3f827b68407399a5338fb7fdc97c
msgid ""
"If the aircraft does not receive a HEARTBEAT message for a period of "
"AFS_GCS_TIMEOUT seconds then it enters a GCS failsafe state. (The default is"
" 10 seconds.) It then looks for a :ref:`AFS_WP_COMMS<AFS_WP_COMMS>` "
"parameter, and if that is non-zero it will change the current target "
"waypoint to the one given in :ref:`AFS_WP_COMMS<AFS_WP_COMMS>`. You should "
"set up a section of your mission with whatever actions you want to take on "
"loss of communications. This jump to a designated mission item normally only"
" occur if the failsafe happens while in AUTO mode. To make it occur in any "
"autothrottle controlled mode ( like CRUISE or GUIDED), you will need to set "
"the :ref:`AFS_OPTIONS<AFS_OPTIONS>` bit 1 (+2 to value of param)."
msgstr ""
"如果飞机在 AFS_GCS_TIMEOUT 秒内未收到 HEARTBEAT 消息（默认 10 秒），则进入 GCS 失控保护状态。此时系统将检查 "
":ref:`AFS_WP_COMMS<AFS_WP_COMMS>` "
"参数，若非零，则将当前目标航点切换为该参数指定的航点。您应在任务中规划好通信中断时希望执行的操作。此跳转至指定任务项通常仅在 AUTO "
"模式下发生失控保护时生效。若要在任何自动油门控制模式（如 CRUISE 或 GUIDED）下也触发，需将 "
":ref:`AFS_OPTIONS<AFS_OPTIONS>` 的第 1 位（参数值 +2）置位。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:206
#: 1606f2be79f340bab9cb699b47df290c
msgid ""
"If GPS lock is lost at the same time as GCS communications is lost then that"
" is considered a \"dual loss\", and the aircraft will immediately terminate "
"if the :ref:`AFS_DUAL_LOSS<AFS_DUAL_LOSS>` is enabled (\"1\")."
msgstr ""
"如果 GPS 丢锁与 GCS 通信中断同时发生，则视为「双重丢失」，若 :ref:`AFS_DUAL_LOSS<AFS_DUAL_LOSS>` "
"已启用（「1」），飞机将立即终止。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:210
#: b3691de1aa7e46e0802c11ad3896efd2
msgid ""
"Note that the monitoring of HEARTBEAT messages only tells the autopilot that"
" it can see messages from the ground station. It does not mean the ground "
"station can see messages from the aircraft. So it is quite possible for your"
" ground station to be reporting loss of communication while the aircraft is "
"still receiving HEARTBEAT messages."
msgstr ""
"请注意，监测 HEARTBEAT "
"消息仅表明飞控能够接收到来自地面站的消息，并不意味着地面站能够接收飞机的消息。因此，完全可能出现地面站报告通信中断、而飞机仍在接收 HEARTBEAT "
"消息的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:216
#: aa78c61c7b2d4304b4f0cd6f0556c8c5
msgid ""
"If :ref:`AFS_MAX_COM_LOSS<AFS_MAX_COM_LOSS>` is set to a non-zero number, "
"then it is used as a maximum count of the number of communication failures "
"that will be allowed while returning to the mission after communications is "
"re-established. This counter is only incremented if the 2nd communication "
"failure happens at least 30 seconds after the previous one (to account for a"
" short period of communications failure)."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`AFS_MAX_COM_LOSS<AFS_MAX_COM_LOSS>` "
"设置为非零数值，则该值用作在通信恢复并返回任务后，允许再次通信故障的最大次数。该计数器仅在第二次通信故障发生在前一次故障至少 30 "
"秒之后时才递增（以排除短暂的通信故障）。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:223
#: d44f8baf697a464491a8822f6a8bcbd2
msgid ""
"IF the GSC loss is recovered while in this failsafe state, then, normally, "
"the mission item pointer is returned to whatever mission item was active "
"when the failsafe occurred. To prevent this, and continue on with whatever "
"missions sequence is executing due to the failsafe, you will need to set the"
" :ref:`AFS_OPTIONS<AFS_OPTIONS>` bit 0 (+1 to the value)."
msgstr ""
"如果在此失控保护状态下 GCS "
"通信恢复，通常情况下任务项指针将返回到失控保护发生时正在执行的任务项。若要阻止此行为并继续执行因失控保护而正在执行的任务序列，需将 "
":ref:`AFS_OPTIONS<AFS_OPTIONS>` 的第 0 位（参数值 +1）置位。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:225
#: 796fd26cb2b2467d8f057e5875ddba0b
msgid ""
"even if the GSC AFS failsafe was entered from a mode other than AUTO, and "
"the :ref:`AFS_OPTIONS<AFS_OPTIONS>` bit 0 is set, the vehicle will start "
"executing the current item pointed to when the failsafe was entered, even "
"though it was not in AUTO mode."
msgstr ""
"即使 GCS AFS 失控保护是从非 AUTO 模式下触发的，只要 :ref:`AFS_OPTIONS<AFS_OPTIONS>` 第 0 "
"位已置位，飞机也会开始执行失控保护触发时所指向的当前任务项，即使当时并非 AUTO 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:228
#: ced9c75dd95b49058bf624b84c2dcd11
msgid "RC Loss"
msgstr "RC 信号丢失"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:230
#: fe96587204e044aaa930d9c6efb8ffc8
msgid ""
"If RC control is lost in for more than "
":ref:`AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME<AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME>` milliseconds, flight termination "
"is activated. This termination mode is only enabled if "
":ref:`AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME<AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME>` is non-zero and "
":ref:`AFS_ENABLE<AFS_ENABLE>` is 1. For the OBC rules it should be set to "
"1500 (giving 1.5 seconds)."
msgstr ""
"如果 RC 控制丢失超过 :ref:`AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME<AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME>` 毫秒，将激活飞行终止。此终止模式仅在 "
":ref:`AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME<AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME>` 非零且 :ref:`AFS_ENABLE<AFS_ENABLE>` "
"为 1 时启用。对于 OBC 规则，应将其设置为 1500（即 1.5 秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:233
#: db81bcd2934e49b18aebc6ee882e9412
msgid ""
"If :ref:`AFS_RC_MAN_ONLY<AFS_RC_MAN_ONLY>` is set to 1 then this will only "
"occur if in a manual mode. Otherwise, it will occur in any flight mode."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`AFS_RC_MAN_ONLY<AFS_RC_MAN_ONLY>` 设置为 "
"1，则仅在手动模式下才会触发此终止。否则，在任何飞行模式下均会触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:236
#: 1db05e0d7e354349a975c516b27d1e58
msgid "Monitoring the AFS system"
msgstr "监测 AFS 系统"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:238
#: 38697264b365414eade3d4981de758cd
msgid ""
"The AFS system provides some additional parameters to make it easier to "
"monitor the health of the failsafe system using external electronics (such "
"as an external failsafe board)."
msgstr "AFS 系统提供了一些附加参数，方便使用外部电子设备（如外置失控保护板）来监测失控保护系统的健康状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:242
#: c19924da13cc4019a77114c6b7eae4bc
msgid "The key parameters are:"
msgstr "关键参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:244
#: 2d6835a152c44f69b5f002b85b64dfda
msgid ""
":ref:`AFS_TERM_PIN<AFS_TERM_PIN>`: This is a digital pin which is set to a "
"high voltage if termination is started. Note that this pin will go high on "
"termination even if the :ref:`AFS_TERM_ACTION<AFS_TERM_ACTION>` parameter is"
" not set to 42."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AFS_TERM_PIN<AFS_TERM_PIN>`：这是一个数字引脚，终止启动时该引脚输出高电平。请注意，即使 "
":ref:`AFS_TERM_ACTION<AFS_TERM_ACTION>` 参数未设置为 42，终止时该引脚也会变为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:247
#: b06f83cfc16448f1b87cb2f2341a0e6a
msgid ""
":ref:`AFS_HB_PIN<AFS_HB_PIN>`: This is a digital pin number for a pin which "
"is toggled at a rate of 10Hz by the failsafe system. If termination occurs "
"and a :ref:`AFS_TERM_PIN<AFS_TERM_PIN>` value is not set then the heartbeat "
"pin will stop toggling."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AFS_HB_PIN<AFS_HB_PIN>`：这是一个数字引脚编号，失控保护系统以 10Hz 频率切换该引脚电平。如果终止发生且未设置 "
":ref:`AFS_TERM_PIN<AFS_TERM_PIN>` 值，则心跳引脚将停止切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:251
#: 1d62d031c7054841abe1bf96f587ca6e
msgid ""
":ref:`AFS_MAN_PIN<AFS_MAN_PIN>`: This is a digital pin number for a pin "
"which goes high when the aircraft is in MANUAL mode. It may be useful with "
"some external failsafe boards to detect manual mode and behave differently."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AFS_MAN_PIN<AFS_MAN_PIN>`：这是一个数字引脚编号，飞机处于 MANUAL "
"模式时该引脚输出高电平。对于某些外置失控保护板，可用于检测手动模式并采取不同响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:257
#: 052db13ea7e64284b104a7c8adaecdab
msgid "Manual Termination"
msgstr "手动终止"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:259
#: 0954ae83b3c04b319523fdc57ee8bc64
msgid ""
"Apart from automatic termination it is also important for the aircraft's "
"operator to be able to terminate the aircraft immediately if they think the "
"aircraft is a danger to people or other aircraft. To force an immediate "
"termination you should use the :ref:`AFS_TERMINATE<AFS_TERMINATE>` "
"parameter. By setting that parameter to 1 the aircraft will immediately "
"terminate."
msgstr ""
"除自动终止外，飞机操作员也需要能够在认为飞机对人员或其他飞行器构成危险时立即终止飞机。要强制立即终止，应使用 "
":ref:`AFS_TERMINATE<AFS_TERMINATE>` 参数。将该参数设置为 1，飞机将立即终止。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:266
#: 1d8382f8e2014254a93dedd9dd600ccc
msgid "AFS_OPTIONS"
msgstr "AFS_OPTIONS"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:267
#: 72caf953e01147d4bce84247fcc0cbda
msgid ""
"The behavior of AFS due to GSC loss can be modified by the setting of the "
":ref:`AFS_OPTIONS<AFS_OPTIONS>` bitmask parameter (no bits are set by "
"default):"
msgstr ""
"AFS 因 GCS 通信丢失而产生的行为可通过 :ref:`AFS_OPTIONS<AFS_OPTIONS>` "
"位掩码参数进行修改（默认所有位均未置位）："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:269
#: ff94064dcf4444c498761ae03ed0fd82
msgid ""
"bit 0 (+1), if set, the aircraft will continue with the current mission item"
" even after GCS connection is recovered. If not set, the aircraft will jump "
"back to the mission item right before GCS failsafe occurs"
msgstr "第 0 位（+1），若置位，飞机将在 GCS 连接恢复后继续执行当前任务项。若未置位，飞机将跳回 GCS 失控保护发生前的任务项。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:270
#: 9dd27778921546c1b8eefdbe50b13021
msgid ""
"bit 1 (+2), if set, will also force entering AUTO when GCS failsafe occurs "
"while in any throtlled controlled modes other than AUTO (ie CRUISE, GUIDED, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"第 1 位（+2），若置位，当 GCS 失控保护在 AUTO 以外的自动油门控制模式（如 CRUISE、GUIDED 等）下触发时，也会强制进入 "
"AUTO 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:273
#: 09306472ce134d0493d172aec4649a96
msgid "Example AFS failsafe mission"
msgstr "AFS 失控保护任务示例"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:275
#: 88c47bbeecd748aea73f1d33b8d2816d
msgid ""
"Setting up a AFS failsafe mission takes time, and needs to be done very "
"carefully. To help you understand what is possible you may find the "
"following example files useful"
msgstr "设置 AFS 失控保护任务需要时间，且必须非常仔细。为帮助您理解可实现的功能，以下示例文件可供参考："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:279
#: fb1510d97a8c498c83d2abf05b2c84c4
msgid ""
"A `waypoint mission "
"<https://github.com/tridge/cuav/blob/master/cuav/data/way.txt>`__ for the "
"2014 Outback Challenge with waypoints for different AFS failures commented "
"in the file"
msgstr ""
"2014 年 Outback Challenge 的 `航点任务 "
"<https://github.com/tridge/cuav/blob/master/cuav/data/way.txt>`__，文件中注释了不同 "
"AFS 故障对应的航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:282
#: 3190a371c2b64120850d36f8d4c48494
msgid ""
"A `geofence file "
"<https://github.com/tridge/cuav/blob/master/cuav/data/fence.txt>`__ for the "
"2014 Outback Challenge"
msgstr ""
"2014 年 Outback Challenge 的 `围栏文件 "
"<https://github.com/tridge/cuav/blob/master/cuav/data/fence.txt>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:286
#: f16d3fe0db2b42aaac7aea614e282b20
msgid "Testing the AFS system in SITL"
msgstr "在 SITL 中测试 AFS 系统"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:288
#: efabf671ac684ca69135576acc30c231
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that you extensively test the AFS system using the "
":ref:`SITL simulation system <dev:simulation-2>` before using it on a real "
"aircraft. You can simulate all types of in-flight failures using the SIM\\_ "
"parameters. To start SITL in Kingaroy ready for OBC testing you would use:"
msgstr ""
"强烈建议在将 AFS 系统用于真实飞机之前，使用 :ref:`SITL 仿真系统 <dev:simulation-2>` 对其进行充分测试。您可以使用 "
"SIM\\_ 参数模拟各种飞行中故障。要在 Kingaroy 启动 SITL 以进行 OBC 测试，请使用以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:298
#: b7d735312d4f49f88837c5e221d88454
msgid "The key parameters for failsafe testing in SITL are:"
msgstr "SITL 中失控保护测试的关键参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:300
#: e793c99e912e4d9383ee4a48c7abcb76
msgid "Test GPS failure: param set SIM_GPS_DISABLE 1"
msgstr "测试 GPS 故障：param set SIM_GPS_DISABLE 1"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:301
#: dc23f1d4fe044553b500895f6cbc3c8c
msgid "Test RC failure: param set SIM_RC_FAIL 1"
msgstr "测试 RC 故障：param set SIM_RC_FAIL 1"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:302
#: f7f2988c6e684b1d8b15e00417fef612
msgid "Test comms failure: set heartbeat 0"
msgstr "测试通信故障：set heartbeat 0"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:303
#: 5f7f6d12233f4ffe8777e26de563704a
msgid "Test fence failure: switch to CRUISE mode and fly across boundary"
msgstr "测试围栏故障：切换至 CRUISE 模式并飞越边界"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:304
#: ff0f83eaaa40454999da9879a2cece2b
msgid ""
"Test QNH failure: param set :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` = 100"
msgstr "测试 QNH 故障：param set :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` = 100"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:307
#: e285600ae5e74dc0a13f6f653444f3e3
msgid "Additional tips for AFS failsafe users"
msgstr "AFS 失控保护用户的额外建议"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:309
#: 6eff5460c4e54a4ea06bec7901831ee8
msgid ""
"You need to ensure that your geofence is enabled before takeoff. This can "
"either be done as part of your preflight checklist, or you could set a "
"`FENCE_CHANNEL`` and enable it from within your transmitter.  This ensures "
"that if your transmitter is out of range that the fence remains enabled."
msgstr ""
"您需要确保在起飞前已启用电子围栏。可以将其纳入起飞前检查清单，或设置 `FENCE_CHANNEL`` "
"并通过遥控器启用，以确保遥控器超出范围时围栏仍保持启用状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:315
#: bf83e49d69a64a399679ca19e8371d27
msgid "Settings for Outback Challenge 2014"
msgstr "Outback Challenge 2014 的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:317
#: 233c6d7ab77d4eb789d29b44673baa9f
msgid ""
"To be compliant with the OBC 2014 rules you should have the following "
"settings:"
msgstr "要符合 OBC 2014 规则，应进行以下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:320
#: c47aab76e89e46c48fcedb6b98c130cd
msgid ":ref:`AFS_ENABLE<AFS_ENABLE>`: 1"
msgstr ":ref:`AFS_ENABLE<AFS_ENABLE>`：1"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:321
#: 031145b5b4644c36a52e5afdfc55f29e
msgid ""
":ref:`AFS_WP_COMMS<AFS_WP_COMMS>`: waypoint number for OBC comms hold "
"followed by two minute loiter, then return to airfield home"
msgstr ":ref:`AFS_WP_COMMS<AFS_WP_COMMS>`：OBC 通信中断时保持盘旋两分钟，然后返回机场 Home 点的航点编号"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:323
#: 5e1690ecd8334078bfb1a126195b181d
msgid ""
":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>`: waypoint number to loiter in place "
"for 30 seconds, followed by return to airfield home"
msgstr ":ref:`AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS<AFS_WP_GPS_LOSS>`：原地盘旋 30 秒后返回机场 Home 点的航点编号"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:325
#: c1206e4c22e84ba1bb616063dab00f54
msgid ":ref:`AFS_TERM_ACTION<AFS_TERM_ACTION>`: 42"
msgstr ":ref:`AFS_TERM_ACTION<AFS_TERM_ACTION>`：42"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:326
#: 6f1ee538c5904d69b200977371041ccc
msgid ":ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>`: 914"
msgstr ":ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>`：914"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:327
#: 44f44c79aafe4409bfbc1261cca7482b
msgid ""
":ref:`AFS_QNH_PRESSURE<AFS_QNH_PRESSURE>`: correct QNH pressure for the day"
msgstr ":ref:`AFS_QNH_PRESSURE<AFS_QNH_PRESSURE>`：飞行当天正确的 QNH 气压值"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:328
#: 604d0c6b1f874de8a06965c49ad3adc5
msgid ":ref:`AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME<AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME>`: 1500"
msgstr ":ref:`AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME<AFS_RC_FAIL_TIME>`：1500"

